            "relativePublishTimeDescription": "2 months ago",
            "rating": 5,
            "text": {
                "text": "I was there in 2023 as I was passing through that town via motorcycle. I can honestly say that it was one of the best moments I have while traveling in Taiwan. The cakes and drinks were not overly expensive, and I had a great time. (I had two mango cakes, and a raw lemonade beverage)",
                "languageCode": "en"
            },
            "originalText": {
